That sounds as if either you're giving the wrong amount (protection is
granted when you give at least 400x and less than 600x your level in
gold) or your protection hasn't disappeared at all _or_ it was eaten
by a gremlin at some point, which might[1] mess up getting it back via
donations if the amount is larger than 8 points.

[1] i don't know the source on this case; but i _think_ an actual lost
protection intrinsic conserves the protection amount; the much more
common nullification of protection (via angry god e.g.) leaves the
intrinsic intact but sets your protection amount to zero.

